Package: ShapeToolKit
Type: Package
Title: Morphometric Shape Analysis and Visualization Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Colin", "Hassenbach", email = "c.hassenbach@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Vincent", "Bonhomme", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Author of 'Momocs', from which code in R/momocs_*.R is derived"),
    person("Sandrine", "Picq", role = "ctb", comment = "'Momocs' author"),
    person("Cedric", "Gaucherel", role = "ctb", comment = "'Momocs' author"),
    person("Julien", "Claude", role = "ctb", comment = "'Momocs' author"))
Description: Tools for morphometric shape analysis, including elliptical
    Fourier analysis (EFA), principal component analysis (PCA), convex hull
    analysis, morphospace gap detection and stability analysis, and a 'shiny'
    application covering image processing, shape analysis, statistics and
    visualization. Parts of the elliptical Fourier and outline-processing
    code are derived from the 'Momocs' package by Bonhomme et al. (2014)
    <doi:10.18637/jss.v056.i13>.
